From 326dcb3ae76bc21da7b980bd43a1abeab65b7ac3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: yaoyuping <yaoyuping@hygon.cn>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 21:12:45 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 18/24] step5: fuse router GEMM + shared-expert gate_up +
 SwigluStep into one split-K kernel

VLLM_HCU_STEP5_FUSED_ROUTER_SHARED=1 (default). Decode M<=64 only; the shared
expert consumes the activation keyed by (stream, shape) since functionalization
gives the gate and shared expert different input buffers. 26.9us vs ~39us per
layer; bs32 64k/4k decode 1128-1132 -> 1139.3 tok/s (with the memcpy removal).

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 model_executor/models/step5_text.py           |  76 ++++++-
 models/step5/nvidia/ops/triton/router_gemm.py | 187 ++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 261 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

